# Text files are stored with LF in git. Visual Studio's own files (solution, projects) are kept with Windows line endings on a Windows checkout,
# so opening them in Visual Studio never shows up as a change.
* text=auto
*.sln text eol=crlf
*.csproj text eol=crlf
*.props text eol=crlf
*.xaml text eol=crlf
*.cs text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
